  ("p", "I do this as a service if you want it done for you: <a href=\"/resume.html\">an ATS-safe resume rebuild</a>, optionally with tailored applications. And <a href=\"/apply.html\">Apply OS</a> is the free tracker for keeping the applications themselves straight."),
